{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "MiniMax-M3.1-Flash Anthropic 兼容接口",
    "description": "MiniMax-M3.1-Flash 通过 Anthropic Messages 协议调用的完整 API 参考。\n\n**兼容说明**：\n- 路径：`/v1/messages`（Anthropic 标准路径）\n- 请求 / 响应结构与 Anthropic Messages API 一致\n- 已支持字段：`model` `messages`（必填）`system` `max_tokens` `temperature` `top_p` `stream` `thinking` `output_config` `tools` `tool_choice` `metadata`\n\n**模型能力**：\n- 上下文长度：**1,000,000 tokens**（1M）\n- 最大输出：**524,288 tokens**（512K），推荐 **131,072 tokens**（128K），思考 token 计入其中\n- 思考模式：始终开启，通过 `output_config.effort` 调节思考深度，默认 `max`；思考内容通过 `content[type=thinking]` block 返回\n- 多模态输入：支持文本、图像、视频内容块\n- 上下文缓存：相同前缀自动命中，命中部分体现在 `usage.cache_read_input_tokens`\n\n多轮对话时，请原样回传完整 assistant 内容块，包括 `thinking`（含 `signature`）与 `tool_use`。",
    "license": {
      "name": "MIT"
    },
    "version": "1.0.0"
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "https://direct.evolink.ai",
      "description": "生产环境（推荐）"
    },
    {
      "url": "https://api.evolink.ai",
      "description": "备用地址"
    }
  ],
  "security": [
    {
      "bearerAuth": []
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/v1/messages": {
      "post": {
        "summary": "MiniMax-M3.1-Flash Messages 接口（Anthropic 兼容）",
        "description": "- 使用 Anthropic Messages 协议调用 MiniMax-M3.1-Flash 模型\n- 请求 / 响应结构与 Anthropic API 对齐\n- **多模态对话**：`content` 支持文本、图像、视频内容块\n- **系统提示词**：通过顶层 `system` 传入\n- **思考模式**：始终开启，`output_config.effort` 调节思考深度；思考内容通过 `content[type=thinking]` block 返回\n- **流式输出**：SSE 事件流\n- **工具调用**：兼容 Anthropic `tool_use` / `tool_result` 流程\n\n**流式事件**：`message_start` → `content_block_start` → `content_block_delta`（`thinking_delta` / `signature_delta` / `text_delta` / `input_json_delta`）→ `content_block_stop` → `message_delta` → `message_stop`，期间可能穿插 `ping`。最终用量以 `message_delta` 事件中的 `usage` 为准。",
        "operationId": "createMessageMiniMaxM31Flash",
        "tags": [
          "Messages"
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CreateMessageRequest"
              },
              "examples": {
                "simple": {
                  "summary": "最小可运行请求",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "MiniMax-M3.1-Flash",
                    "max_tokens": 131072,
                    "messages": [
                      {
                        "role": "user",
                        "content": "Hello! How can you help me?"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                "system_prompt": {
                  "summary": "使用系统提示词",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "MiniMax-M3.1-Flash",
                    "max_tokens": 131072,
                    "system": "You are a technical editor. Keep your answers clear and concise.",
                    "messages": [
                      {
                        "role": "user",
                        "content": "Describe the benefits of clear technical documentation in three sentences."
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                "effort": {
                  "summary": "调节思考深度（output_config.effort）",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "MiniMax-M3.1-Flash",
                    "max_tokens": 131072,
                    "output_config": {
                      "effort": "high"
                    },
                    "messages": [
                      {
                        "role": "user",
                        "content": "A bat and a ball cost 1.10 in total. The bat costs 1.00 more than the ball. How much does the ball cost?"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                "image_understanding": {
                  "summary": "图像理解（多模态内容块）",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "MiniMax-M3.1-Flash",
                    "max_tokens": 131072,
                    "messages": [
                      {
                        "role": "user",
                        "content": [
                          {
                            "type": "text",
                            "text": "What is shown in this image?"
                          },
                          {
                            "type": "image",
                            "source": {
                              "type": "url",
                              "url": "https://example.com/image.jpeg"
                            }
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                "video_understanding": {
                  "summary": "视频理解（多模态内容块）",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "MiniMax-M3.1-Flash",
                    "max_tokens": 131072,
                    "messages": [
                      {
                        "role": "user",
                        "content": [
                          {
                            "type": "text",
                            "text": "Summarize this video."
                          },
                          {
                            "type": "video",
                            "source": {
                              "type": "url",
                              "url": "https://example.com/video.mp4",
                              "fps": 1
                            }
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                "tool_use": {
                  "summary": "工具调用（Anthropic tool_use 风格）",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "MiniMax-M3.1-Flash",
                    "max_tokens": 131072,
                    "messages": [
                      {
                        "role": "user",
                        "content": "Check the stock for product demo-item-001."
                      }
                    ],
                    "tools": [
                      {
                        "name": "get_product_stock",
                        "description": "Get the current stock level for a product.",
                        "input_schema": {
                          "type": "object",
                          "properties": {
                            "product_id": {
                              "type": "string",
                              "description": "Product identifier."
                            }
                          },
                          "required": [
                            "product_id"
                          ]
                        }
                      }
                    ],
                    "tool_choice": {
                      "type": "auto"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "streaming": {
                  "summary": "流式输出（SSE）",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "MiniMax-M3.1-Flash",
                    "max_tokens": 131072,
                    "stream": true,
                    "messages": [
                      {
                        "role": "user",
                        "content": "Write a short poem about spring."
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "消息对象",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/MessageResponse"
                },
                "examples": {
                  "with_thinking": {
                    "summary": "包含思考内容（thinking block）",
                    "value": {
                      "id": "072514f09a86ce2abb0c5c3930f924fb",
                      "type": "message",
                      "role": "assistant",
                      "model": "MiniMax-M3.1-Flash",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "thinking": "Let the ball cost x. Then 2x + 1 = 1.10, so x = 0.05.",
                          "signature": "84eddf556420e0cc237f8f50212216543e8add2ddd931c9a271d2a5a95689333",
                          "type": "thinking"
                        },
                        {
                          "text": "0.05",
                          "type": "text"
                        }
                      ],
                      "usage": {
                        "input_tokens": 55,
                        "output_tokens": 66,
                        "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0,
                        "cache_read_input_tokens": 174,
                        "output_tokens_details": {
                          "thinking_tokens": 63
                        }
                      },
                      "stop_reason": "end_turn",
                      "base_resp": {
                        "status_code": 0,
                        "status_msg": ""
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "direct_answer": {
                    "summary": "直接回答（无思考内容）",
                    "value": {
                      "id": "072514d15927960e42b730074205a1c6",
                      "type": "message",
                      "role": "assistant",
                      "model": "MiniMax-M3.1-Flash",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "text": "Recursion is a technique in which a function calls itself to solve smaller instances of a problem.",
                          "type": "text"
                        }
                      ],
                      "usage": {
                        "input_tokens": 23,
                        "output_tokens": 6,
                        "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0,
                        "cache_read_input_tokens": 184
                      },
                      "stop_reason": "end_turn",
                      "base_resp": {
                        "status_code": 0,
                        "status_msg": ""
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "tool_use": {
                    "summary": "触发工具调用（stop_reason=tool_use）",
                    "value": {
                      "id": "072514d3fb0f7ce9f7c9fdd22755fffc",
                      "type": "message",
                      "role": "assistant",
                      "model": "MiniMax-M3.1-Flash",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "tool_use",
                          "id": "call_function_ih2iv0ggec0p_1",
                          "name": "get_product_stock",
                          "input": {
                            "product_id": "demo-item-001"
                          }
                        }
                      ],
                      "usage": {
                        "input_tokens": 283,
                        "output_tokens": 31,
                        "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0,
                        "cache_read_input_tokens": 174
                      },
                      "stop_reason": "tool_use",
                      "base_resp": {
                        "status_code": 0,
                        "status_msg": ""
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "请求参数错误",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "type": "error",
                  "request_id": "req_xxx",
                  "error": {
                    "type": "invalid_request_error",
                    "message": "Invalid request"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "身份验证错误",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "type": "error",
                  "error": {
                    "type": "authentication_error",
                    "message": "Authentication error"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "402": {
            "description": "配额不足",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "type": "error",
                  "error": {
                    "type": "billing_error",
                    "message": "Insufficient quota"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "权限错误",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "type": "error",
                  "error": {
                    "type": "permission_error",
                    "message": "Permission denied"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "模型或资源不存在",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "type": "error",
                  "error": {
                    "type": "not_found_error",
                    "message": "Model not found"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "429": {
            "description": "速率限制",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "type": "error",
                  "error": {
                    "type": "rate_limit_error",
                    "message": "Rate limited"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "内部服务器错误",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "502": {
            "description": "网关错误",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "503": {
            "description": "服务暂时不可用",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "components": {
    "schemas": {
      "CreateMessageRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "model",
          "messages"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "model": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "要调用的模型",
            "enum": [
              "MiniMax-M3.1-Flash"
            ],
            "example": "MiniMax-M3.1-Flash"
          },
          "max_tokens": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "生成内容长度上限（Token 数），**包含思考和回答**\n\n**说明**：\n- 推荐 **131,072**（128K），最大 **524,288**（512K）\n- 取值过小时可能在思考阶段就达到上限，返回 `stop_reason=max_tokens` 且没有 text 内容",
            "minimum": 1,
            "maximum": 524288,
            "example": 131072
          },
          "messages": {
            "type": "array",
            "description": "对话消息列表，按轮次 user / assistant 交替\n\n**说明**：\n- 至少包含 1 条消息\n- 最后一条消息通常为 `role=user`",
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/InputMessage"
            },
            "minItems": 1
          },
          "system": {
            "description": "系统提示词，用于设定 AI 角色与行为。支持字符串或文本内容块数组，通过顶层 `system` 字段传入。",
            "oneOf": [
              {
                "type": "string",
                "example": "You are a helpful assistant."
              },
              {
                "type": "array",
                "description": "内容块数组格式的系统提示词",
                "items": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": [
                    "type",
                    "text"
                  ],
                  "properties": {
                    "type": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "enum": [
                        "text"
                      ]
                    },
                    "text": {
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          "temperature": {
            "type": "number",
            "description": "采样温度\n\n**说明**：\n- 范围 `[0, 2]`，默认 1\n- 值越高越发散，越低越确定\n- 建议不要同时调整 temperature 与 top_p",
            "minimum": 0,
            "maximum": 2,
            "default": 1,
            "example": 1
          },
          "top_p": {
            "type": "number",
            "description": "核采样阈值\n\n**说明**：\n- 范围 `[0, 1]`，默认 0.95\n- 建议不要同时调整 temperature 与 top_p",
            "minimum": 0,
            "maximum": 1,
            "default": 0.95,
            "example": 0.95
          },
          "stream": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "是否以 SSE 流式返回\n\n- `true`：Server-Sent Events 流式返回\n- `false`：完整响应后一次性返回（默认）",
            "default": false,
            "example": false
          },
          "thinking": {
            "type": "object",
            "description": "思考模式。MiniMax-M3.1-Flash 始终进行思考，仅支持 `adaptive`，可省略。思考内容以 `type=\"thinking\"` 的 block 返回，按输出 token 计费",
            "required": [
              "type"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "type": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": [
                  "adaptive"
                ],
                "default": "adaptive"
              }
            }
          },
          "output_config": {
            "type": "object",
            "description": "输出配置",
            "properties": {
              "effort": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "思考深度，默认 `max`。较高档位通常会增加思考 token 消耗和响应时间。",
                "enum": [
                  "low",
                  "medium",
                  "high",
                  "xhigh",
                  "max"
                ],
                "default": "max",
                "example": "high"
              }
            }
          },
          "tools": {
            "type": "array",
            "description": "工具定义列表\n\n**说明**：\n- 遵循 Anthropic tool 定义规范\n- `input_schema` 使用 JSON Schema 对象",
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Tool"
            }
          },
          "tool_choice": {
            "type": "object",
            "description": "工具选择策略，仅支持 `auto`（由模型决定是否调用工具）",
            "required": [
              "type"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "type": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": [
                  "auto"
                ]
              }
            }
          },
          "metadata": {
            "type": "object",
            "description": "请求元数据",
            "properties": {
              "user_id": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "代表终端用户的唯一标识符，可用于按用户维度做监控与滥用检测（建议使用散列后的 ID）"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "InputMessage": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "role",
          "content"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "role": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "user",
              "assistant"
            ],
            "description": "消息发送方角色，user / assistant 交替\n\n- `user`：用户消息（也用于回传 `tool_result` block）\n- `assistant`：助手历史回复（可含 `text` / `thinking` / `tool_use` blocks）\n\n系统提示通过顶层 `system` 字段传入。"
          },
          "content": {
            "description": "消息内容\n\n**说明**：\n- 纯文本时直接传字符串\n- 结构化时传 content block 数组（`text` / `image` / `video` / `tool_use` / `tool_result` / `thinking`）",
            "oneOf": [
              {
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ContentBlock"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "ContentBlock": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "消息内容块\n\n**支持 type**：\n- `text`：文本内容\n- `image`：图片输入（URL 或 base64，JPEG / PNG / GIF / WEBP）\n- `video`：视频输入（URL、base64 或 `mm_file://{file_id}`，MP4 / AVI / MOV / MKV）\n- `tool_use`：回传上一轮 assistant 工具调用\n- `tool_result`：工具执行结果\n- `thinking`：回传上一轮 assistant 思考内容（含 `signature`）",
        "required": [
          "type"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "type": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "text",
              "image",
              "video",
              "tool_use",
              "tool_result",
              "thinking"
            ]
          },
          "text": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "当 type=`text` 时的文本内容"
          },
          "source": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/MediaSource",
            "description": "图片或视频来源，type=`image` 或 type=`video` 时使用"
          },
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "工具调用 ID（tool_use 时必填）"
          },
          "name": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "工具名（tool_use 时必填）"
          },
          "input": {
            "type": "object",
            "description": "工具入参（tool_use 时，JSON 对象）"
          },
          "tool_use_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "对应的工具调用 ID（tool_result 时必填，回填到 tool_use.id）"
          },
          "content": {
            "description": "工具执行结果（tool_result），字符串或 content block 数组",
            "oneOf": [
              {
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "type": "object"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          "thinking": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "历史助手消息中的思考内容（`type=thinking` 时使用）"
          },
          "signature": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "思考内容签名，多轮对话时需原样回传"
          }
        }
      },
      "Tool": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "name",
          "input_schema"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "name": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "工具名称\n\n**说明**：\n- 只允许 `a-zA-Z0-9_-`\n- 最大 64 字符"
          },
          "description": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "工具功能描述，供模型判断何时调用"
          },
          "input_schema": {
            "type": "object",
            "description": "工具入参的 JSON Schema 对象\n\n**说明**：\n- `type` 必须为 `object`\n- 应声明 `properties` 与 `required`"
          }
        }
      },
      "MediaSource": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "图片或视频内容块的媒体来源\n\n- 图片支持 JPEG / PNG / GIF / WEBP，单张最大 10 MB\n- 视频支持 MP4 / AVI / MOV / MKV，URL / Base64 最大 50 MB；更大的视频通过 `mm_file://{file_id}` 文件引用传入\n- 请求体最大 64 MB",
        "required": [
          "type"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "type": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "base64",
              "url"
            ],
            "description": "媒体来源类型"
          },
          "media_type": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "base64 输入时必填，例如 `image/png` 或 `video/mp4`"
          },
          "data": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "base64 编码后的媒体字节"
          },
          "url": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "公网 URL；视频还可使用形如 `mm_file://{file_id}` 的文件引用"
          },
          "detail": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "low",
              "default",
              "high"
            ],
            "default": "default",
            "description": "理解精细度，默认 default。分辨率越高 token 消耗越多"
          },
          "fps": {
            "type": "number",
            "minimum": 0.2,
            "maximum": 5,
            "default": 1,
            "description": "视频抽帧频率，默认 1，范围 [0.2, 5]。较高的抽帧频率有利于捕捉画面变化，通常也会增加 token 消耗。"
          },
          "max_long_side_pixel": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1,
            "description": "图片或视频帧最长边像素约束"
          }
        }
      },
      "MessageResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "Anthropic 风格的消息响应",
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "消息唯一 ID"
          },
          "type": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "message"
            ],
            "description": "响应对象类型"
          },
          "role": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "assistant"
            ]
          },
          "model": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "实际使用的模型",
            "example": "MiniMax-M3.1-Flash"
          },
          "content": {
            "type": "array",
            "description": "响应内容块列表\n\n**可能包含的 block type**：\n- `thinking`：思考过程（简单问题可能不产生）\n- `text`：最终回答文本\n- `tool_use`：模型发起的工具调用",
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/OutputContentBlock"
            }
          },
          "stop_reason": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "停止原因\n\n- `end_turn`：自然结束\n- `max_tokens`：达到 max_tokens 上限\n- `tool_use`：模型触发工具调用",
            "enum": [
              "end_turn",
              "max_tokens",
              "tool_use"
            ]
          },
          "usage": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/AnthropicUsage"
          },
          "base_resp": {
            "type": "object",
            "description": "状态码和错误详情",
            "properties": {
              "status_code": {
                "type": "integer",
                "description": "状态码，`0` 表示成功"
              },
              "status_msg": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "错误详情"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "OutputContentBlock": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "响应中的内容块",
        "properties": {
          "type": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "text",
              "thinking",
              "tool_use"
            ]
          },
          "text": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "type=`text` 时的文本"
          },
          "thinking": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "type=`thinking` 时的推理过程文本"
          },
          "signature": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "type=`thinking` 时的完整性签名，用于多轮上下文校验"
          },
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "type=`tool_use` 时的工具调用 ID"
          },
          "name": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "type=`tool_use` 时的工具名"
          },
          "input": {
            "type": "object",
            "description": "type=`tool_use` 时模型生成的 JSON 入参"
          }
        }
      },
      "AnthropicUsage": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "Token 使用统计（Anthropic 规范）",
        "properties": {
          "input_tokens": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "未命中缓存的输入 token 数（不含 `cache_read_input_tokens`）",
            "example": 55
          },
          "output_tokens": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "输出 token 数（含 thinking）",
            "example": 66
          },
          "cache_creation_input_tokens": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "缓存创建的输入 token 数，自动缓存下为 0",
            "example": 0
          },
          "cache_read_input_tokens": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "命中缓存的输入 token 数，按缓存命中价计费。完整输入 = `input_tokens + cache_read_input_tokens`",
            "example": 174
          },
          "output_tokens_details": {
            "type": "object",
            "description": "输出 token 详细分项",
            "properties": {
              "thinking_tokens": {
                "type": "integer",
                "description": "思考产生的 token 数（已计入 `output_tokens`）",
                "example": 63
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "ErrorResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "type": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "error"
            ]
          },
          "error": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "type": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "错误类型（如 invalid_request_error / authentication_error / billing_error 等）"
              },
              "message": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "错误描述"
              }
            }
          },
          "request_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "请求追踪 ID"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "securitySchemes": {
      "bearerAuth": {
        "type": "http",
        "scheme": "bearer",
        "description": "所有接口均需要使用 Bearer Token 进行认证\n\n**获取 API Key**：\n\n访问 [API Key 管理页面](https://evolink.ai/dashboard/keys) 获取您的 API Key\n\n**使用时在请求头中添加**：\n```\nAuthorization: Bearer YOUR_API_KEY\n```\n\n**备注**：EvoLink 对 `/v1/messages` 统一采用 Bearer Token 鉴权。"
      }
    }
  },
